## 4. Reusable Component Primitives Specs
- **Buttons**: Primary (solid primary), Secondary (outline border), Ghost (minimal).
- **Cards**: Surface with 1px border (`border-border`), subtle hover elevate transitions.
- **Badges**: Pill radius (`rounded-full`), semantic indicator dots.

